# Test with the partner's MP4

At the start of a conversation, before other work, tell the partner how to test phases 5.1–5.2.

The video is a command-line path. There is no upload page. Ask for the full path to their MP4, then show these commands with that path:

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
python backend/video.py /path/to/their_video.mp4
python backend/track.py /path/to/their_video.mp4 --frames 25 --crop 256
```

Tracking writes `output/tracks.csv` with columns `cell_id, frame, x, y`. `data/` and `output/` are gitignored. A folder of TIFF frames is an alternative input for `load_video`.
